# Automation

## Automation model

The `AutomationEngine` supports trigger-driven actions. The current foundation includes:

- voice triggers;
- manual triggers;
- scheduled routines;
- app launch triggers;
- notification triggers;
- system event triggers.

## Example routines

- Good Morning
- Good Night
- Work
- Study
- Focus
- Silent
- Travel

## Execution model

Automation rules are represented as triggers plus ordered actions. The design can be expanded for scheduled WorkManager jobs and app lifecycle monitoring.
